The '''Shedian''' were inhabitants of [[the galaxy]]. Their word for memory was almost identical to their word for revenge.<ref name="What a Festive Evening">{{Andor|What a Festive Evening}}</ref>

In [[3 BBY]], [[Davo Sculdun]], a [[Chandrilan]] mentioned the Shedian while showing off artifacts in [[Davo Sculdun's gallery|his private gallery]] on [[Coruscant]] to several guests of the [[Senate Investiture]] [[Davo Sculdun's party|party]] he was hosting.<ref name="What a Festive Evening" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Shedian were first mentioned in the [[What a Festive Evening|sixth episode]] of the [[Andor Season 2|second season]] of the television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'',<ref name="What a Festive Evening" /> which aired on [[Disney+]] on [[April 29]], [[2025]]<ref name="Trailer News">{{SW|url=news/andor-season-2-teaser-trailer-key-art-reveal|text=First ''Andor A Star Wars Story'' Teaser Trailer and Poster Revealed}}</ref>

